OL,3,ATate brothers blast US jail conditions
OL,4,Aas they seek bail in UK extradition
OL,5,Afight
OL,6,
OL,7,FGovernment lawyers argued the two were
OL,8,Fa flight risk and had bragged about
OL,9,Fhaving multiple passports, while
OL,10,Fdefence attorneys said the social media
OL,11,Finfluencers' high profile would make it
OL,12,Falmost impossible for them to flee.
OL,14,FUS Magistrate Judge Lauren Louis will
OL,15,Fissue a written ruling at a later date
OL,16,Fon whether to grant bail to the dual
OL,17,FBritish-US citizens. The pair were
OL,18,Farrested in Miami on 19 July.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
